<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back stock at NZ$7.08/share.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back stock at NZ$7.08/share.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of NZ said it had bought back 957,562 shares on Wednesday at NZ$7.08 each, bringing the total number of issued shares to 1,804,272,236.</p>
<p>The total excludes 37,788,154 held as treasury stock.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
